  "description": "<p>⭐ <strong>Edinburgh The Royal City: Day Tour from London</strong> allows you to experience the historic city of Edinburgh, with its medieval streets, hidden passageways, and centuries-old buildings.</p><p><strong>Ticket types</strong><br />🎫 Adult ticket for the day tour trip from London to Edinburgh<br />🎫 Child ticket for the day tour trip from London to Edinburgh</p><p><strong>Highlights</strong><br />🚆 Experience a whole day adventuring in Scotland's capital with return train tickets from London's Kings Cross to Edinburgh with reserved seats<br />🚌 Explore the city sights effortlessly on a Hop-on Hop-off sightseeing bus tour of Edinburgh<br />🏰 Step foot into Edinburgh Castle and absorb the rich history of Scotland's most renowned monument</p><p><strong>General info<br /></strong>📅 Dates and times: select your dates in the session selector - the start time for this experience is 6:30 am<strong><br /></strong>📍 Location:&nbsp;The tour takes place in Edinburgh.<br />⏳ Duration:&nbsp;Length of time: 16 hours.</p><p><strong>Description</strong><br />Embark on an exhilarating journey to Scotland's enchanting capital, courtesy of a full-day tour from London! Brace yourself for a thrilling ride through time as you board our reserved train seats and traverse the medieval streets of Edinburgh. Prepare to be awe-struck by the majestic Edinburgh Castle, discover hidden gems with a delightful hop-on sightseeing bus tour, and completely immerse yourself in the opulence of its vibrant culture. Get ready for an extraordinary adventure that you absolutely cannot afford to miss!</p><p>📝 <strong>Additional info</strong></p><ul><li>No guide will accompany you on this tour.</li><li>You will travel by train in standard class with seats reserved.</li><li>The train from Edinburgh leaves around 5PM and arrives in London around 10PM.</li><li>Your electronic tickets and vouchers will be sent to you beforehand via email.</li><li>It is suggested to arrive at London Kings Cross Station 30 minutes before your scheduled train departure time.</li></ul>",
